bring you the condolence money

286
00:13:38,260 --> 00:13:39,560
and funeral expenses shortly.

287
00:13:39,560 --> 00:13:40,940
Hurry home

288
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:43,160
and arrange the funeral.

289
00:13:46,010 --> 00:13:48,410
Later, I found out Wan Yang
was embezzling.

290
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:51,160
Where is the money?

291
00:13:51,590 --> 00:13:53,400
The supplier has transferred
all the kickbacks

292
00:13:53,400 --> 00:13:55,280
to Hong's account,

293
00:13:55,300 --> 00:13:56,610
totaling 630,000.

294
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:57,860
Don't worry, Yang.

295
00:14:02,090 --> 00:14:02,950
I reported him.

296
00:14:03,750 --> 00:14:05,110
I reported to the higher authorities.

297
00:14:05,110 --> 00:14:07,090
I'd like to file a formal, named complaint

298
00:14:07,090 --> 00:14:08,330
against Wan Yang, director
of the Wugang Petrochemical

299
00:14:08,330 --> 00:14:09,730
Gas Distribution Plant.

300
00:14:09,870 --> 00:14:11,410
[Notice of Special Investigation]

301
00:14:10,210 --> 00:14:11,490
The investigation team came,

302
00:14:11,490 --> 00:14:13,490
and I finally had someone to turn to.

303
00:14:14,020 --> 00:14:15,290
I found the air raid shelter,

304
00:14:15,290 --> 00:14:16,400
the goods,

305
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:17,490
the stolen money,

306
00:14:17,520 --> 00:14:19,850
and the channel
Sun Jie used to fence them.

307
00:14:20,210 --> 00:14:21,090
I told all of this

308
00:14:21,090 --> 00:14:22,940
to the investigation team.

309
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:24,040
Realizing he had

310
00:14:24,040 --> 00:14:26,440
nowhere left to turn,

311
00:14:27,430 --> 00:14:29,030
Wan Yang jumped to his death.

312
00:14:30,630 --> 00:14:31,750
Wan Yang died.

313
00:14:32,310 --> 00:14:34,860
Geng Jian took over
as the acting director.

314
00:14:35,260 --> 00:14:37,130
While helping the investigation team

315
00:14:37,130 --> 00:14:38,210
sort out the belongings

316
00:14:38,210 --> 00:14:39,940
and documents left by Wan Yang,

317
00:14:40,370 --> 00:14:41,800
I accidentally found

318
00:14:41,800 --> 00:14:42,680
something.

319
00:14:43,440 --> 00:14:46,480
[Decision on Early Release by the
Wugang County Public Security Bureau]

320
00:14:44,640 --> 00:14:45,370
I thought

321
00:14:45,370 --> 00:14:47,100
we couldn't entrust
the future

322
00:14:47,250 --> 00:14:48,040
of our plant to someone

323
00:14:48,040 --> 00:14:49,450
with a criminal record.

324
00:14:50,190 --> 00:14:51,760
What if people find out

325
00:14:51,930 --> 00:14:53,770
our plant's top executive

326
00:14:54,800 --> 00:14:57,050
has a prior conviction
for soliciting prostitutes?

327
00:14:57,050 --> 00:14:59,260
Team Leader Pan later asked me

328
00:15:00,300 --> 00:15:02,550
about my ideas

329
00:15:03,160 --> 00:15:04,360
and plans for reform.

330
00:15:06,190 --> 00:15:08,640
That's how I became director
of the gas distribution plant.

331
00:15:08,640 --> 00:15:09,640
We hereby appoint Comrade Qi Mo

332
00:15:09,640 --> 00:15:11,840
as the director
of the Wugang Petrochemical

333
00:15:11,840 --> 00:15:12,760
Gas Distribution Plant

334
00:15:12,760 --> 00:15:13,780
for a three-year term.

335
00:15:13,780 --> 00:15:14,930
My dawn has come.

336
00:15:15,660 --> 00:15:16,980
I proposed to Ying,

337
00:15:18,050 --> 00:15:19,090
and she happily

338
00:15:19,090 --> 00:15:20,000
married me.

339
00:15:20,210 --> 00:15:21,370
At that time, I felt

340
00:15:21,510 --> 00:15:23,690
that love, career, and life

341
00:15:23,720 --> 00:15:25,120
all seemed bright.

342
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:26,630
God favored me.

343
00:15:27,330 --> 00:15:28,760
My future was bright.

344
00:15:28,760 --> 00:15:29,450
But right at that time,

345
00:15:29,450 --> 00:15:30,830
you got into trouble.

346
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:32,160
You went into prison.

347
00:15:32,460 --> 00:15:33,490
You stayed in prison for three years.

348
00:15:33,490 --> 00:15:33,970
After you came out,

349
00:15:33,970 --> 00:15:35,210
you went home

350
00:15:35,210 --> 00:15:36,740
and said those things to me.

351
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:39,210
You said Ma Yiming

352
00:15:39,230 --> 00:15:40,640
saw me outside the valve pit.

353
00:15:40,640 --> 00:15:41,400
You insisted

354
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:42,640
that I killed your father.

355
00:15:42,640 --> 00:15:44,280
Shan, I really didn't kill him.

356
00:15:44,280 --> 00:15:45,850
I just want to know

357
00:15:46,730 --> 00:15:48,260
what you are hiding from us.

358
00:15:48,680 --> 00:15:49,880
What were you doing?

359
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:52,680
Because I was responsible
for overseeing

360
00:15:52,680 --> 00:15:55,940
construction on the section
where the accident happened.

361
00:15:56,130 --> 00:15:58,370
M-My mother suddenly

362
00:15:58,370 --> 00:15:59,520
became seriously ill at that time.

363
00:15:59,520 --> 00:16:02,580
I was also afraid
that Wan Yang would stop me,

364
00:16:02,640 --> 00:16:04,100
so I ran home for three days

365
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:05,760
under the guise of

366
00:16:05,760 --> 00:16:07,360
construction supervision.

367
00:16:07,850 --> 00:16:10,130
But who could have thought
that after completion,

368
00:16:10,130 --> 00:16:12,330
there would be a pipeline leak.

369
00:16:12,330 --> 00:16:13,570
I was worried

370
00:16:14,020 --> 00:16:15,960
that it was the section
I was responsible for,

371
00:16:15,960 --> 00:16:16,910
so I went

372
00:16:16,940 --> 00:16:18,880
to check near the valve pit.

373
00:16:18,910 --> 00:16:20,290
But on that very day,

374
00:16:20,310 --> 00:16:22,840
your father was killed
in an explosion there.

375
00:16:23,420 --> 00:16:25,070
But I really was responsible

376
00:16:25,310 --> 00:16:28,460
for the section where the leak occurred.

377
00:16:29,240 --> 00:16:30,810
Could I say the truth?

378
00:16:31,220 --> 00:16:32,500
If I had said it then,

379
00:16:33,030 --> 00:16:34,400
Ying would have divorced me.

380
00:16:34,400 --> 00:16:35,280
If I had said it,

381
00:16:35,280 --> 00:16:36,400
you and Ying would have thought

382
00:16:36,400 --> 00:16:37,280
I was indirectly responsible

383
00:16:37,280 --> 00:16:38,090
for your dad's death.

384
00:16:38,090 --> 00:16:38,800
If I had said it,

385
00:16:38,800 --> 00:16:39,640
my position as director

386
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:40,610
would be gone.

387
00:16:40,730 --> 00:16:42,540
My career had just started.

388
00:16:42,570 --> 00:16:43,490
I couldn't let this destroy

389
00:16:43,490 --> 00:16:44,920
the future I'd worked so hard for.

390
00:16:44,920 --> 00:16:45,760
All my hard work

391
00:16:45,760 --> 00:16:46,490
would have been for nothing.

392
00:16:46,490 --> 00:16:47,870
I had no choice but to lie.

393
00:16:47,870 --> 00:16:49,470
What's wrong with you, Qi Mo?

394
00:16:52,090 --> 00:16:52,570
Do you know

395
00:16:52,570 --> 00:16:53,590
how many people were harmed

396
00:16:53,590 --> 00:16:55,190
because of this lie of yours?

397
00:16:55,680 --> 00:16:56,610
Let me tell you.

398
00:16:57,670 --> 00:17:00,200
You underestimated me Ying.

399
00:17:00,890 --> 00:17:02,730
With the feelings
you two had at that time,

400
00:17:02,730 --> 00:17:04,190
would she not believe you?

401
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:07,000
You keep saying it was for the plant

402
00:17:07,020 --> 00:17:08,000
and Ying.

403
00:17:08,680 --> 00:17:09,960
Actually,

404
00:17:09,960 --> 00:17:11,880
you did it for yourself!

405
00:17:11,880 --> 00:17:12,960
Do you realize how many detours

406
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:14,300
we've had to take because
of your selfishness?

407
00:17:14,300 --> 00:17:14,780
Yes.

408
00:17:15,030 --> 00:17:16,960
I admit you're right about everything.

409
00:17:16,960 --> 00:17:18,490
I was too selfish back then.

410
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:21,630
I also admit

411
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:24,660
that I overestimated myself.

412
00:17:27,540 --> 00:17:28,740
I lacked experience.

413
00:17:29,500 --> 00:17:30,960
I was in too much of a hurry.

414
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:32,680
But look at me now.

415
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:33,980
What else

416
00:17:34,290 --> 00:17:35,420
do you want from me?

417
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:36,800
I have nothing left.

418
00:17:36,830 --> 00:17:37,790
Do you want me to die?

419
00:17:37,790 --> 00:17:38,500
Shan.

420
00:17:38,520 --> 00:17:39,940
I also want to know now

421
00:17:40,070 --> 00:17:41,550
who exactly...

422
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:45,330
killed your father.

423
00:18:01,770 --> 00:18:02,480
There's still a chance

424
00:18:02,480 --> 00:18:04,080
for you to make things right.

425
00:18:05,720 --> 00:18:07,780
There's a chance to uncover the truth

426
00:18:08,010 --> 00:18:10,140
and bring the real culprit to justice.

427
00:18:12,180 --> 00:18:13,910
I need you to cooperate with me.

428
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:28,680
Qi Mo just called me.

429
00:18:29,340 --> 00:18:29,880
Yeah.

430
00:18:29,530 --> 00:18:34,220
[Finance Department]

431
00:18:30,240 --> 00:18:31,610
He called both of us too.

432
00:18:32,130 --> 00:18:33,770
He said he wanted to work here

433
00:18:33,790 --> 00:18:35,990
and asked us to put in
a good word for him.

434
00:18:36,010 --> 00:18:37,050
How much hatred do these siblings

435
00:18:37,050 --> 00:18:38,640
have against him?

436
00:18:38,850 --> 00:18:40,570
They used to be a family, after all.

437
00:18:40,570 --> 00:18:41,090
Right now,

438
00:18:41,090 --> 00:18:42,130
he's fallen so low,

439
00:18:42,130 --> 00:18:42,960
and they won't even help him.

440
00:18:42,960 --> 00:18:43,920
I just think

441
00:18:44,010 --> 00:18:46,130
Qi Mo is a highly educated professional

442
00:18:46,130 --> 00:18:46,920
in his field.

443
00:18:47,330 --> 00:18:48,720
We're short-staffed.

444
00:18:49,530 --> 00:18:50,240
Why not give him a chance

445
00:18:50,240 --> 00:18:51,500
to do some useful work?

446
00:18:51,540 --> 00:18:53,720
Let's go. We should help if we can.

447
00:18:54,050 --> 00:18:55,810
Okay, I'll go get an umbrella.

448
00:19:04,640 --> 00:19:05,370
What's wrong?

449
00:19:05,370 --> 00:19:06,700
You can't do it anymore?

450
00:19:06,820 --> 00:19:08,470
Are you giving up already?

451
00:19:08,490 --> 00:19:09,830
That's not like you.

452
00:19:10,570 --> 00:19:11,910
I'm out of options.

453
00:19:11,940 --> 00:19:13,270
I'm asking you for help.

454
00:19:14,770 --> 00:19:16,560
You and Shan are close.

455
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:18,880
Please put in a good word for me with him.

456
00:19:19,050 --> 00:19:21,440
These siblings are not hard-hearted.

457
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:22,880
When you see them,
swallow your pride a little.

458
00:19:22,880 --> 00:19:23,250
Let's go.

459
00:19:23,250 --> 00:19:23,940
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

460
00:19:23,940 --> 00:19:24,340
Hurry.

461
00:19:24,360 --> 00:19:25,090
Let's go.

462
00:19:25,240 --> 00:19:25,680
Hurry.

463
00:19:27,460 --> 00:19:28,020
Come.

464
00:19:31,180 --> 00:19:31,810
Come.

465
00:19:31,810 --> 00:19:33,070
Let's eat first, Ying.

466
00:19:33,070 --> 00:19:34,010
-It'll get cold.
-Shan.

467
00:19:34,010 --> 00:19:35,240
You're treated well.

468
00:19:35,240 --> 00:19:37,040
Food is delivered to the office.

469
00:19:37,180 --> 00:19:37,920
Sit.

470
00:19:37,920 --> 00:19:38,720
What a feast.

471
00:19:38,720 --> 00:19:40,540
Let me introduce you to everyone.

472
00:19:40,540 --> 00:19:41,340
Come, Auntie.

473
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:42,720
This is

474
00:19:42,720 --> 00:19:44,570
Ma Yiming's mother.

475
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:46,480
From now on, our meals here

476
00:19:46,480 --> 00:19:47,680
will be handled by her.

477
00:19:47,680 --> 00:19:49,280
Thank you for your hard work.

478
00:19:49,880 --> 00:19:51,770
-Eat it while it's hot.
-Come on. Have a taste.

479
00:19:51,770 --> 00:19:52,630
It smells good.

480
00:19:52,680 --> 00:19:53,960
-Eat.
-Hey.

481
00:19:54,330 --> 00:19:55,720
Why do you two get chicken legs?

482
00:19:55,720 --> 00:19:56,720
We only have one.

483
00:19:56,850 --> 00:19:57,640
It's unfair.

484
00:19:58,720 --> 00:19:59,830
Unfair?

485
00:20:00,050 --> 00:20:01,660
You say it's unfair?

486
00:20:01,880 --> 00:20:03,750
When my son died back then,

487
00:20:03,880 --> 00:20:06,040
I was so furious
with Chen Shan I could've killed him.

488
00:20:06,040 --> 00:20:07,720
I hit him and yelled at him.

489
00:20:08,010 --> 00:20:09,650
But as soon as Chen Shan
got out of prison,

490
00:20:09,650 --> 00:20:10,820
he went to my house.

491
00:20:10,850 --> 00:20:12,330
I had a heart attack at that time

492
00:20:12,330 --> 00:20:13,610
and was lying on the ground.

493
00:20:13,610 --> 00:20:15,370
He carried me to the hospital on his back

494
00:20:15,370 --> 00:20:17,200
and looked after me
day and night for three days.

495
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:18,010
He also said

496
00:20:18,010 --> 00:20:18,850
Those three days...

497
00:20:18,850 --> 00:20:21,500
he would provide for me in my old age.

498
00:20:21,680 --> 00:20:23,010
If you can do that for me,

499
00:20:23,070 --> 00:20:25,200
I'll give you an extra chicken leg too.

500
00:20:25,440 --> 00:20:26,290
Have a taste.

501
00:20:26,370 --> 00:20:27,090
Mr. Qi.

502
00:20:27,090 --> 00:20:28,000
Come in.

503
00:20:28,020 --> 00:20:28,640
We were just about to eat.

504
00:20:28,640 --> 00:20:29,400
Let's talk after eating.

505
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:29,920
Hurry.

506
00:20:30,010 --> 00:20:32,410
-Let's eat together. Sit down.
-Sit there.

507
00:20:32,720 --> 00:20:33,530
Xiaoyun.

508
00:20:33,530 --> 00:20:34,420
I saved these dishes

509
00:20:34,420 --> 00:20:35,210
for you two.

510
00:20:35,240 --> 00:20:37,530
Eat while it's hot.

511
00:20:38,570 --> 00:20:40,440
I cook for people, not for you.

512
00:20:40,570 --> 00:20:41,880
I'd rather let it go to waste
than give you any!

513
00:20:41,880 --> 00:20:42,680
Okay.

514
00:20:42,770 --> 00:20:43,570
Ma'am.

515
00:20:43,640 --> 00:20:44,680
That's a bit harsh.

516
00:20:44,680 --> 00:20:45,480
I won't eat.

517
00:20:45,680 --> 00:20:46,610
You guys eat.

518
00:20:46,610 --> 00:20:47,370
You guys eat.

519
00:20:47,720 --> 00:20:48,560
Qi Mo.

520
00:20:48,580 --> 00:20:49,610
If you don't remember me,

521
00:20:49,610 --> 00:20:50,240
you should remember

522
00:20:50,240 --> 00:20:51,770
my son, Ma Yiming, right?

523
00:20:51,770 --> 00:20:52,680
What are you doing?

524
00:20:52,680 --> 00:20:54,610
He was almost blown up.

525
00:20:54,610 --> 00:20:57,200
Chen Fu gave his life to save him.

526
00:20:58,640 --> 00:21:00,680
Then he woke up and got better.

527
00:21:00,920 --> 00:21:02,090
But he and Chen Shan

528
00:21:02,090 --> 00:21:03,610
tried to stop a devil like you

529
00:21:03,610 --> 00:21:05,510
from staying by Chen Ying's side.

530
00:21:05,610 --> 00:21:08,380
That's why he ended up
in that car accident!

531
00:21:08,530 --> 00:21:09,400
Don't you owe him for his life?

532
00:21:09,400 --> 00:21:10,390
Calm down.

533
00:21:10,480 --> 00:21:11,680
What does it have to do with me?

534
00:21:11,680 --> 00:21:12,290
What does your son's death

535
00:21:12,290 --> 00:21:13,090
have to do with me?

536
00:21:13,090 --> 00:21:13,920
Stay away!

537
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:16,070
Ma'am.

538
00:21:16,130 --> 00:21:17,640
Your heart is already weak.

539
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:18,370
Don't ruin your health

540
00:21:18,370 --> 00:21:19,440
because of this.

541
00:21:19,440 --> 00:21:20,050
Right.

542
00:21:20,050 --> 00:21:20,400
Come, Ma'am.

543
00:21:20,400 --> 00:21:20,880
Alright.

544
00:21:20,880 --> 00:21:22,180
Please calm down.

545
00:21:22,330 --> 00:21:23,570
Good is rewarded,

546
00:21:23,570 --> 00:21:25,010
and evil is punished!

547
00:21:25,010 --> 00:21:26,240
What are you doing? Don't hit him, Ma'am.

548
00:21:26,240 --> 00:21:27,630
Calm down.

549
00:21:27,720 --> 00:21:28,680
Don't get worked up.

550
00:21:28,680 --> 00:21:30,160
Get some good rest.

551
00:21:32,640 --> 00:21:33,440
Jie.

552
00:21:34,400 --> 00:21:35,530
What does this mean?

553
00:21:36,880 --> 00:21:39,130
Qi Mo's been running a stall
outside the plant gate

554
00:21:39,130 --> 00:21:40,090
for over a month.

555
00:21:40,090 --> 00:21:41,570
Everyone has seen it.

556
00:21:42,050 --> 00:21:44,360
So he must have reflected on his behavior

557
00:21:44,480 --> 00:21:46,290
and changed his ways by now.

558
00:21:46,480 --> 00:21:47,510
So we thought

559
00:21:50,390 --> 00:21:51,570
we'd give him a chance.

560
00:21:51,570 --> 00:21:53,680
Do you think it's appropriate to do this?

561
00:21:53,680 --> 00:21:55,150
So what if he runs
that stall for a whole year?

562
00:21:55,150 --> 00:21:56,880
What does it have to do with you?

563
00:21:57,370 --> 00:21:58,130
You gave him a chance

564
00:21:58,130 --> 00:21:59,090
without even asking us,

565
00:21:59,090 --> 00:21:59,750
didn't you?

566
00:22:06,880 --> 00:22:07,610
Chen Shan.

567
00:22:07,720 --> 00:22:09,200
I have a background in design, after all.

568
00:22:09,200 --> 00:22:10,090
Didn't you hear

569
00:22:10,090 --> 00:22:11,350
what Auntie just said?

570
00:22:12,440 --> 00:22:13,640
What are you here for?

571
00:22:14,220 --> 00:22:15,680
Why did you bring him here?

572
00:22:15,960 --> 00:22:16,640
You came here

573
