Come, help me stick this.

863
00:38:15,240 --> 00:38:15,930
Where?

864
00:38:17,930 --> 00:38:18,530
Here.

865
00:38:18,790 --> 00:38:20,170
Do you know how many people

866
00:38:20,170 --> 00:38:21,930
are dying to join the construction team?

867
00:38:21,930 --> 00:38:23,390
But I don't even want them.

868
00:38:23,650 --> 00:38:25,010
I'm giving you a chance,

869
00:38:25,010 --> 00:38:26,090
but you don't even cherish it.

870
00:38:26,090 --> 00:38:27,970
My legs are my own.

871
00:38:28,270 --> 00:38:30,410
You stubborn dog,

872
00:38:30,410 --> 00:38:32,160
you've really set your mind in stone.

873
00:38:32,160 --> 00:38:33,890
Are you trying to piss me off?

874
00:38:34,690 --> 00:38:35,370
Dad,

875
00:38:36,050 --> 00:38:37,250
if I'm a dog,

876
00:38:37,270 --> 00:38:38,450
what does that make you?

877
00:38:38,450 --> 00:38:40,050
-I…
-The old dog, obviously.

878
00:38:42,200 --> 00:38:43,330
Laughing?

879
00:38:43,680 --> 00:38:44,680
Just you wait.

880
00:38:58,350 --> 00:38:59,470
I remember before,

881
00:39:00,910 --> 00:39:03,170
every time Dad asked me to join the plant,

882
00:39:03,940 --> 00:39:04,680
I couldn't wait

883
00:39:04,680 --> 00:39:06,410
to escape Wugang immediately.

884
00:39:07,990 --> 00:39:09,920
Now I've finally joined the plant,

885
00:39:11,320 --> 00:39:13,520
but it's a shame Dad isn't here to see it.

886
00:39:14,490 --> 00:39:15,410
Dad can see it.

887
00:39:16,800 --> 00:39:17,930
Wherever you are,

888
00:39:19,340 --> 00:39:21,000
you'll always make Dad proud.

889
00:39:22,410 --> 00:39:23,200
Keep it up.

890
00:39:25,460 --> 00:39:26,210
Mr. Chen.

891
00:39:33,790 --> 00:39:37,330
[One year later]

892
00:39:51,060 --> 00:39:51,710
Ying.

893
00:39:52,430 --> 00:39:53,870
Did you get my medicine?

894
00:39:54,020 --> 00:39:55,050
I did.

895
00:39:56,280 --> 00:39:57,610
What's wrong?

896
00:39:58,050 --> 00:39:59,650
I... I slept on my neck wrong.

897
00:40:01,220 --> 00:40:02,030
Here?

898
00:40:04,680 --> 00:40:06,650
Don't move. Don't move. Don't move.

899
00:40:06,650 --> 00:40:07,910
Does it hurt that much?

900
00:40:11,160 --> 00:40:11,970
Ying,

901
00:40:12,670 --> 00:40:13,760
we are going

902
00:40:13,870 --> 00:40:15,460
to the Northwest this time.

903
00:40:16,050 --> 00:40:17,250
Are you okay to drive?

904
00:40:19,940 --> 00:40:21,740
Don't you trust me?

905
00:40:24,210 --> 00:40:25,940
[Practical Road Atlas of China]

906
00:40:25,080 --> 00:40:27,010
The person I trust most in this world

907
00:40:27,010 --> 00:40:27,930
is you.

908
00:40:29,090 --> 00:40:29,970
I bought you some ye'erba.

909
00:40:29,970 --> 00:40:31,170
Eat it while it's hot.

910
00:40:31,800 --> 00:40:33,010
Let's go.

911
00:40:33,260 --> 00:40:34,240
Shan.

912
00:40:34,910 --> 00:40:36,020
Actually...

913
00:40:38,420 --> 00:40:39,830
Honestly, the result

914
00:40:40,890 --> 00:40:41,490
doesn't matter

915
00:40:41,490 --> 00:40:42,890
to me anymore.

916
00:40:47,400 --> 00:40:48,920
But I want to know.

917
00:40:52,440 --> 00:40:53,420
Are you sure?

918
00:40:55,880 --> 00:40:56,680
Let's go.

919
00:41:23,820 --> 00:41:26,070
♪ You guess, I guess ♪

920
00:41:26,170 --> 00:41:28,350
♪ You say, I say ♪

921
00:41:28,460 --> 00:41:31,880
♪ Longing can consume us ♪

922
00:41:31,900 --> 00:41:34,240
♪ No asking, no crying ♪

923
00:41:33,640 --> 00:41:34,720
We've journeyed through the darkness,

924
00:41:34,260 --> 00:41:36,310
♪ No thinking, no speaking ♪

925
00:41:34,720 --> 00:41:36,320
time after time.

926
00:41:36,400 --> 00:41:40,230
♪ The haze slowly clears away ♪

927
00:41:37,800 --> 00:41:39,800
The pain left unspoken,

928
00:41:40,310 --> 00:41:42,930
♪ Being wild, acting spoiled ♪

929
00:41:41,680 --> 00:41:43,130
the answers still unfound—

930
00:41:42,950 --> 00:41:44,730
♪ Unchanged, undefeated ♪

931
00:41:44,560 --> 00:41:46,190
all await the break of dawn.

932
00:41:44,840 --> 00:41:48,280
♪ Growing up starts right now ♪

933
00:41:48,460 --> 00:41:50,470
♪ Don't look back ♪

934
00:41:50,580 --> 00:41:52,600
♪ You see, I see ♪

935
00:41:52,900 --> 00:41:56,260
♪ The sun is rising ♪

936
00:42:00,410 --> 00:42:02,210
No matter how deep the darkness,

937
00:42:03,660 --> 00:42:05,320
the light will find its way in.

938
00:42:06,930 --> 00:42:09,870
Through it all, we'll
walk toward the light

939
00:42:11,090 --> 00:42:12,290
and light the dark.

940
00:42:12,740 --> 00:42:15,930
♪ Your smile is so beautiful ♪

941
00:42:16,710 --> 00:42:20,580
♪ It guards the beat of my heart ♪

942
00:42:20,740 --> 00:42:25,180
♪ Time keeps running on ♪

943
00:42:25,330 --> 00:42:28,850
♪ Your arms are soft and warm ♪

944
00:42:28,880 --> 00:42:32,950
♪ I see the stars smiling ♪

945
00:42:32,970 --> 00:42:37,070
♪ I hear the wind playfully sigh ♪

946
00:42:35,110 --> 00:42:36,760
[After a month of investigation,
Chen Ying and Chen Shan discovered]

947
00:42:36,790 --> 00:42:38,510
[that Chen Ying's biological parents
died in 1978]

948
00:42:37,180 --> 00:42:41,010
♪ Time is still burning bright ♪

949
00:42:38,530 --> 00:42:40,980
[in an accident while surveying
the terrain in the Gobi Desert.]

950
00:42:41,000 --> 00:42:43,810
[The accident was caused
by a minor local earthquake.]

951
00:42:41,040 --> 00:42:49,460
♪ Lighting up the lonely souls
in this world ♪

952
00:42:43,830 --> 00:42:47,140
[Zhang Wenying and Chen Fu
had nothing to do with it.]

953
00:42:47,160 --> 00:42:49,960
[Nor were there any construction
or design flaws, contrary to Wan Yang's claims.]
